OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will stay dry for the
OL,6,FEdinburgh, the Lothians and
OL,7,FBerwickshire with some bright or sunny
OL,8,Fspells, though cloudier for a time in
OL,9,Fthe middle of the day. Quite cloudy
OL,10,Fwith a few light showers in the west.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMostly dry through the
OL,13,Fevening with variable cloud and some
OL,14,Fbright then clear spells. Clouding
OL,15,Fover through the night with outbreaks
OL,16,Fof rain, turning heavy at times in the
OL,17,Fwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
